OL,3,CProgramme listings for SUN 17 MAY
OL,4,G1100FPaddy McGuinness
OL,5,     GPaddy's live from Salford and
OL,6,     Gthis week he's got a few spring
OL,7,     Gclean changes to make. He's got
OL,8,     GThe Weekest Link, a new Time
OL,9,     GWarp, another Big Question and
OL,10,     Gsome shiny new things.
OL,11,G1300FElaine Paige on Sunday
OL,12,     GDame Elaine's celebrating Cher,
OL,13,     Gbaking, and Jordan Luke Gage's
OL,14,     Gnew musical, Redcliffe. There's
OL,15,     Galso the latest stage and screen
OL,16,     Gnews, your requests and Break A
OL,17,     GLeg messages.
OL,18,G1500FSounds of the 70s with Shaun
OL,19,     FKeaveny
OL,20,     GShaun sits in for Bob, with Cher,
OL,21,     GSupertramp and a Eurovision
OL,22,     Gwinner for the Rock Date Diary.
OL,23,Vppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
